        <mxCell id="c199" value="&lt;i&gt;Two views of one workbook, side by side. Left: columns B to F and J to K of the Shipment Table are hidden, and the first 14 In Transit shipments are shown. Right: rows 1 and 2 are scrolled out of view. The review date is 2026-12-31, the year-end under review and the last shipment date. Outlined: the three exception counts, and the SUBTOTAL cells, which agree with the counts for the status selected.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="658" width="860" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
